":"dung.","def":"excrement (as protruded)"},"H6833":{"lemma":"צִפּוֹר","xlit":"tsippôwr","gloss":"bird, fowl, sparrow.","def":"a little bird (as hopping)"},"H6834":{"lemma":"צִפּוֹר","xlit":"Tsippôwr","gloss":"Zippor.","def":"Tsippor, a Moabite"},"H6835":{"lemma":"צַפַּחַת","xlit":"tsappachath","gloss":"cruse.","def":"a saucer (as flat)"},"H6836":{"lemma":"צְפִיָּה","xlit":"tsᵉphîyâh","gloss":"watching.","def":"watchfulness"},"H6837":{"lemma":"צִפְיוֹן","xlit":"Tsiphyôwn","gloss":"Ziphion. Compare H6827 (צְפוֹן).","def":"Tsiphjon, an Israelite"},"H6838":{"lemma":"צַפִּיחִת","xlit":"tsappîychith","gloss":"wafer.","def":"a flat thin cake"},"H6839":{"lemma":"צֹפִים","xlit":"Tsôphîym","gloss":"Zophim.","def":"Tsophim, a place East of the Jordan"},"H6840":{"lemma":"צָפִין","xlit":"tsâphîyn","gloss":"hid.","def":"a treasure (as hidden)"},"H6841":{"lemma":"צְפִיר","xlit":"tsᵉphîyr","gloss":"he (goat).","def":"a he-goat"},"H6842":{"lemma":"צָפִיר","xlit":"tsâphîyr","gloss":"(he) goat.","def":"a male goat (as prancing)"},"H6843":{"lemma":"צְפִירָה","xlit":"tsᵉphîyrâh","gloss":"diadem, morning.","def":"a crown (as encircling the head); also a turn of affairs (i.e. mishap)"},"H6844":{"lemma":"צָפִית","xlit":"tsâphîyth","gloss":"watchtower.","def":"a sentry"},"H6845":{"lemma":"צָפַן","xlit":"tsâphan","gloss":"esteem, hide(-den one, self), lay up, lurk (be set) privily, (keep) secret(-ly, place).","def":"to hide (by covering over); by implication, to hoard or reserve; figuratively to deny; specifically (favorably) to protect, (unfavorably) to lurk"},"H6846":{"lemma":"צְפַנְיָה","xlit":"Tsᵉphanyâh","gloss":"Zephaniah.","def":"Tsephanjah, the name of four Israelites"},"H6847":{"lemma":"צׇפְנַת פַּעְנֵחַ","xlit":"Tsophnath Paʻnêach","gloss":"Zaphnath-paaneah.","def":"Tsophnath-Paneach, Joseph's Egyptian name"},"H6848":{"lemma":"צֶפַע","xlit":"tsephaʻ","gloss":"adder, cockatrice.","def":"a viper (as thrusting out the tongue, i.e. hissing)"},"H6849":{"lemma":"צְפִעָה","xlit":"tsᵉphiʻâh","gloss":"issue.","def":"an outcast thing"},"H6850":{"lemma":"צָפַף","xlit":"tsâphaph","gloss":"chatter, peep, whisper.","def":"to coo or chirp (as a bird)"},"H6851":{"lemma":"צַפְצָפָה","xlit":"tsaphtsâphâh","gloss":"willow tree.","def":"a willow (as growing in overflowed places)"},"H6852":{"lemma":"צָפַר","xlit":"tsâphar","gloss":"depart early.","def":"to skip about, i.e. return"},"H6853":{"lemma":"צְפַר","xlit":"tsᵉphar","gloss":"bird.","def":"a bird."},"H6854":{"lemma":"צְפַרְדֵּעַ","xlit":"tsᵉphardêaʻ","gloss":"frog.","def":"a marsh-leaper, i.e. frog"},"H6855":{"lemma":"צִפֹּרָה","xlit":"Tsippôrâh","gloss":"Zipporah.","def":"Tsipporah, Moses' wife"},"H6856":{"lemma":"צִפֹּרֶן","xlit":"tsippôren","gloss":"nail, point.","def":"properly, a claw, i.e. (human) nail; also the point of astyle (or pen, tipped with adamant)"},"H6857":{"lemma":"צְפַת","xlit":"Tsᵉphath","gloss":"Zephath.","def":"Tsephath, a place in Palestine"},"H6858":{"lemma":"צֶפֶת","xlit":"tsepheth","gloss":"chapiter.","def":"a capital of a column"},"H6859":{"lemma":"צְפָתָה","xlit":"Tsᵉphâthâh","gloss":"Zephathah.","def":"Tsephathah, a place in Palestine"},"H6860":{"lemma":"צִקְלַג","xlit":"Tsiqlag","gloss":"Ziklag.","def":"Tsiklag or Tsikelag, a place in Palestine"},"H6861":{"lemma":"צִקְלֹן","xlit":"tsiqlôn","gloss":"husk.","def":"a sack (as tied at the mouth)"},"H6862":{"lemma":"צַר","xlit":"tsar","gloss":"adversary, afflicted(-tion), anguish, close, distress, enemy, flint, foe, narrow, small, sorrow, strait, tribulation, trouble.","def":"narrow; (as a noun) a tight place (usually figuratively, i.e. trouble); also a pebble ; (transitive) an opponent (as crowding)"},"H6863":{"lemma":"צֵר","xlit":"Tsêr","gloss":"Zer.","def":"Tser, a place in Palestine"},"H6864":{"lemma":"צֹר","xlit":"tsôr","gloss":"flint, sharp stone.","def":"a stone (as if pressed hard or to a point); (by implication, of use) a knife"},"H6865":{"lemma":"צֹר","xlit":"Tsôr","gloss":"Tyre, Tyrus.","def":"Tsor, a place in Palestine"